'''Flower Cat Awakens!''' (開眼のネコフラワー襲来！''Kaigan no Nekofurawā Shūrai!'', '''Awakened Flower Cat Attacks!''') is a secret limited stage that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|update 6.2]]. The player will unlock [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Flower Cat]]'s [[True Form]] upon completion.

